  m_Name: JohnDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcName: John
  dialogueLine:
  - Welcome New Adventure!
  - We are here to teach you some basic.
  - There are 3 weapon slots you can swap to. And Relic to increase your stats
  - Press F1 (Default) to look at your inventory. (Look at setting for your keybinds)
  - 'You can level up to 30 levels. Each level give you 1 stats point to use. '
  - At level 15 you can change your class to 3 classes.Each class have there own
    ability to use.
  - Ranger. High damage but low survivability.
  - Tank. High survivability but low damage.
  - Priest. Mid for both survivability and damage but can support others.
  - There is a target dummy to test your weapon. You can come back to me anytime
    to try out your new weapon.
  textSpeed: 0.05
  autoProgressDeley: 1.5
